udfb5Incredible soundtrack crafted by ModalModule (Arcus Chroma, Legend of Kendor), accompanied by great SFX brought by Pixel Audio (Spiritfarer, Jotun, STAR WARS\u2122: Squadrons\u2026)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500180/extras/2be94687fb561ca4f29af7c6240d47d7.poster.avif?t=1753539840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500180/extras/2be94687fb561ca4f29af7c6240d47d7.webm?t=1753539840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500180/extras/2be94687fb561ca4f29af7c6240d47d7.mp4?t=1753539840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Grab your punching gloves, put your clogs on, it's time to SMASH.</strong>",
